          "RuleFilters": {
            "description": "The filters that select the product's Managed APIs. Required for RULE_BASED, rejected for CUSTOM. Filters are combined with AND, the values within one filter with OR, and evaluated only over the account's Managed APIs. Replaced as a whole on update, not merged.",
